Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `a` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/string_edit_immutable_binding.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     a.insert(0, "x")
    |     ^
 Why: `insert: fn(&self, Int, String)` changes the value it's called on, so `a` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `a := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111

